   AGUEL MINE SHAFT                                               Dungeon AM\
-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-\
\
     ITEMS: Crest, Heal Berry X 3               ----------------------------\
     ARMS: AM Cluster (Brad)                   |  ENEMIES: Giant Crab       |\
