   TUNNEL TO SIELJE REGION                                        Dungeon TS\
-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-\
\
     ITEMS: Heal Berry, Duplicator              ----------------------------\
     ARMS: DeadOrAlive (Ashley)                |  ENEMIES: Spudhead         |\
