   Okay, those attacks hurt a little bit more than last time around, especially\
   since you've got 2 magic users in your party by necessity, with low DFP.\
   I say, hammer it on early, before she wears down your party beyond easy\
   healing capacity.  Either that, or take it slow while keeping your party up\
   to max HP as a priority.  Either way, you know the boss fights from here on\
