You now have access to the Sonar!  Another screen will appear when on the world\
map.  Field search items will appear as yellow dots, and destinations will\
appear as green dots.  Only locations that can be opened at this point will\
show up, however.\
\
   --------------------------------------------\
     On route to Coffin of 100 Eyes\
   --------------------------------------------\
\
Teleport to Quartly and walk S and slightly E, halfway down the desert, to\
locate it.  Now that you've got the sonar, it should be a breeze to locate new\
areas and field search items.\
\
-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-\
   COFFIN OF 100 EYES                                             Dungeon CE\
-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-\
\
