    ---------------------------+     Drill          5000    2500     2500\
                                     Chest          5000    2500     2500\
\
       ATTACKS              EFFECT\
       Drill Drager         Spear single target with drill for heavy damage\
       Resonance Quake      Earthquake damages all targets\
       Megaton Attack       Heavy slam for massive damage on single target\
