\
   So now we're bringing out the big guns, eh?  Belleclaire's attacks do some\
   serious damage, so watch out.  Expect for characters to be killed in a\
   single blow several times, especially once he starts using his megaton\
   attack.  Be prepared to switch out your party members if you need to,\
   bringing in healthier ones with some FP stored towards the end of the fight.\
   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *\
