Ahead, you face a wide row of giant blocks that will roll over you.  Only one\
of them can be destroyed, and you can tell which one because it flashes when\
you bomb it.  In the first row, it's the second from the right, then the left-\
most one in the second row, and finally, the block in the very middle of the\
last row.  It only takes a couple of hits.  It might just be easier to let the\
things roll over you, though.  After that, climb the circular pillar, keeping\
pressed against the wall at all times to avoid falling off and having to\
restart your climb.  At the top, the big man who lent his name to the pillar\
awaits for a final showdown.\
\
