Fly around in the Chateau and watch the radar to locate the green dot telling\
you where it is.  You can only reach it via Live Reflector, as it's on the same\
land mass as the Raline Observatory.  Take the reflector from Sylvaland, Holst,\
or Meria Boule region, choosing the Dragon's Vein teleport.  From there, head N\
up a narrow trail that leads to a large, dark mountain/volcano.  Search along\
