-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-\
   FIERY WRECKAGE                                                 Dungeon FW\
-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-\
\
     ARMOR: Red Jacket (Ashley)                 ----------------------------\
     WEAPONS: Obelisk Gun (Ashley)             |  ENEMIES: Sabertooth       |\
                                               |           Gel Gob          |\
                                                ----------------------------\
