The yellow floating spheres are teleport orbs.  Touch the first one, then read\
the stone where you end up.  Following the instructions, head through the E\
door, then the W door in the next room, and then go back through the single\
door you just came through.  Read the plaque on the side of the staircase.\
Following this hint, go up the stairs and look at the far wall, where you might\
note that the orange squares spell the word "RAY".  Go into the next room and\
input this word at the rock in the middle, and it'll open the way to the\
Guardian of Light.\
