LOCATION: Various.  See below.\
\
First of all, you need to have completed the hidden areas within the\
Sacrificial Altars to find the idols (see walkthrough above, section 'Dungeon\
SA').  You have three stone idols, and three tasks to unlock their powers:\
\
1. Have Tim talk to Collette in Baskar Village.\
2. Have Brad talk to the wheelchair-bound Billy in T'Bok Village.\
