-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-\
\
     ITEMS: Crest E, Ambrosia                   ----------------------------\
     GEAR: Elven Boots, Elven Cloak,           |  ENEMIES: Nybbas           |\
           Talisman, Kid Gloves, Power Boost   |           Shambler         |\
                                               |           (outside)        |\
