Mediums in the party's possession.  Check pg. 3 under Tim's status in the menu\
to see his list of abilities.  To learn abilities, equip Tim with the\
appropriate Medium, and have him kill the listed number of enemies in battles.\
Other party members can wound the monsters, but Tim has to deal the finishing\
blow, either through physical attacks or with magic.\
