=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\
   9g) EXPERIENCE POINTS/LEVEL\
=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\
\
Here are the number of points each character must gain to reach each next\
level.  The number refers to the points needed since reaching the previous\
level.  So for example, to go from level 10 to level 11, each character must\
gain an additional 1650 points.\
\
Lvl   Exp          Lvl   Exp          Lvl   Exp          Lvl   Exp\
=============      =============      =============      =============\
11    +1650        12    +1800        13    +1800        14    +2000\
15    +2500        16    +3000        17    +4000        18    +5000\
19    +6000        20    +6500        21    +6500        22    +9500\
23    +10000       24    +12000       25    +14000       26    +17000\
27    +17000       28    +17000       29    +18000       30    +19000\
31    +23000       32    +24000       33    +26000       34    +26000\
35    +26000       36    +26000       37    +27000       38    +27000\
39    +29000       40    +29000       41    +38000       42    +38000\
43    +38000       44    +44000       45    +45000       46    +54000\
47    +61000       48    +62000       49    +62000       50    +62000\
51    +70000       52    +76000       53    +82000       54    +88000\
55    +94000       56    +100000      57    +100000      58    +100000\
59    +100000      60    +100000      61    +100000      62    +100000\
63    +100000      64    +100000      ...I could keep going, but you get the\
                                         point from here on in.\
\
