=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\
   9h) DUPLICATOR LOCATIONS\
=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\
\
This list was specially requested, as these are difficult to locate in the\
game, but are invaluable for opening all of those magically-sealed chests and\
doors.  Most of them found using the field search function, and these are much\
easier to locate once you have Kanon with her radar ability in your party.\
\
    # found   | Location\
   =========================================================================\
        1     | In field, between Sylvaland Castle and Halmetz\
        1     | Tunnel to Sielje Region, in chest\
        1     | In field in Quartly Desert\
        1     | Slayheim Castle, in chest\
        1     | In field, en route to Closed Mine Shaft\
        1     | Coffin of 100 Eyes, in chest\
        4     | Grotto of Lourdes, in chests in secret room\
        1     | In field, across mountain range from S Urartu Station\
        1     | In field, on NW tip of island with Raypoint Flam\
        1     | Lost Garden in chest\
    unlimited | Steal from Babalous near Meteorite Crater in S of world map\
    unlimited | Dropped by Hyulkontons (see Monster Album for location)\
   =========================================================================\
\
