obtained from defeating them, Boss's HP, what they divide into (using Tim's\
level 3 force ability), and the location for finding them.  Thanks to Djameson\
for his excellent monster FAQ that helped me locate that last half-dozen\
monsters in the outer sea that continued to elude me.\
